{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107270","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910727001:1":{"text":"刚才、刚才发生了什么？我看到了一场灾难，还有陆地上的景象……","source_cn":"刚才、刚才发生了什么？我看到了一场灾难，还有陆地上的景象……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xABF1CF7155B1CFCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910727002:1":{"text":"那道空气中突然出现的光墙，和<style=stress...","source_cn":"那道空气中突然出现的光墙，和<style=stress...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910727003:1":{"text":"<male>他</male><female>她</fe...","source_cn":"<male>他</male><female>她</fe...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910727004:1":{"text":"这是<male>他</male><female>她</...","source_cn":"这是<male>他</male><female>她</...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910727005:1":{"text":"我……我没听说过，连阿嬷的记录里都没有出现过能淹没陆地...","source_cn":"我……我没听说过，连阿嬷的记录里都没有出现过能淹没陆地...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910727006:1":{"text":"如果真的发生过，塔拉萨的长辈一定会编童谣来警戒小孩子，...","source_cn":"如果真的发生过，塔拉萨的长辈一定会编童谣来警戒小孩子，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910727007:1":{"text":"难道是更遥远的过去吗……？或者，不是过去，是未来……？","source_cn":"难道是更遥远的过去吗……？或者，不是过去，是未来……？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x88F9AECBEBE0D9D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910727008:1":{"text":"未来……你是说预言？那是骗幼童的，没经过洄游季的人才会信。","source_cn":"未来……你是说预言？那是骗幼童的，没经过洄游季的人才会信。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB503E7C3371A9A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910727009:1":{"text":"我希望看到的是预言，如果是预言，灾难就不会发生……<s...","source_cn":"我希望看到的是预言，如果是预言，灾难就不会发生……<s...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910727010:1":{"text":"如果有更多像<male>他</male><female...","source_cn":"如果有更多像<male>他</male><female...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1